                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-smtp">
                                <i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text text-primary me-3"></i> How do I set up SMTP Email?
                            </button>
