                        <div id="faq-smtp" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-muted bg-white">
                                <p>By default, invoices come from <em>noreply@businessbetter.co.uk</em>. To send them from <strong>your</strong> email address:</p>
                                <ol>
                                    <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> > <strong>Email Configuration</strong>.</li>
                                    <li>Toggle "Use Custom SMTP" to ON.</li>
                                    <li>Enter your provider details (e.g., Gmail, Outlook, or Fasthosts).</li>
                                    <li><strong>Host:</strong> <code>smtp.livemail.co.uk</code> (for Fasthosts) or <code>smtp.gmail.com</code>.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Port:</strong> Usually <code>587</code> (TLS) or <code>465</code> (SSL).</li>
                                    <li>Enter your email address and password.</li>
                                    <li>Click <strong>"Test Connection"</strong>.</li>
                                </ol>
                                <div class="alert alert-warning small"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i> <strong>Note:</strong> If using Gmail, you must generate an "App Password" in your Google Account settings first.</div>
