                            <div class="accordion-body text-muted bg-white">
                                <p>To track a vehicle's MOT, Tax, and Service history:</p>
                                <ol>
                                    <li>Navigate to the <strong>Fleet</strong> tab in your dashboard.</li>
                                    <li>Click the blue <strong>+ Add Vehicle</strong> button.</li>
                                    <li>Enter the <strong>Registration Number</strong> (VRM).</li>
                                    <li>Our system will automatically pull the Make/Model from the DVLA database.</li>
                                    <li>Assign a "Default Driver" if one person uses this van permanently.</li>
                                </ol>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

