                    <p class="text-secondary">Under GDPR, you have the right to request a full export of your data or the "Right to be Forgotten". Please contact <a href="mailto:dpo@businessbetter.co.uk" class="text-gold">dpo@businessbetter.co.uk</a> for requests.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
