                <p><strong>The Deep Dive:</strong> We compare your "As-Built" drawings against the Geotechnical Report and <strong>Building Regulations Part A</strong>. We demonstrate that the Engineer's design failed, not your workmanship. Liability shifts from the Contractor to the Design Team.</p>
